{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>李佳芯與林愷鈴今日聯同呂爵安現身汽車品牌活動，為即將播出港版《悠長假期》造勢宣傳。席間眾人除分享拍攝點滴與聖誕動向，更罕有回應近日城中熱話。面對昔日緋聞對象破產及走數傳聞，壽星女李佳芯親自揭開二人金錢轇轕真實內幕。</p>\n<h2>港版《悠長假期》宣傳活動大爆拍攝秘辛</h2>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》落實於聖誕及跨年檔期播出，李佳芯與林愷鈴及呂爵安今日齊齊出席汽車品牌宣傳活動。李佳芯坦言看過劇集製作特輯後才驚覺自己擁有偶像包袱，回想當時日夜顛倒拍攝至天昏地暗，更對著鏡頭講出大量廢話並留下不少黑圖，對最終剪輯效果感到十分好奇。明日迎來生日兼聖誕佳節將至，李佳芯透露節日期間仍需繼續開工拍劇，而同場拍檔亦有即場向壽星女送上祝福。</p>\n<h2>李佳芯親自澄清陳恩德走數傳聞真相</h2>\n<p>針對昔日緋聞對象蟲草大王陳恩德近日遭入稟申請破產一事，坊間更有傳聞指男方昔日食飯走數，李佳芯受訪時大方作出回應。她明確澄清自己並無遭遇走數情況，更笑言：「我有請佢飲嘢。」以幽默方式化解外界對二人金錢糾紛疑慮。另一方面，林愷鈴成為駕車話題焦點，尚未考獲車牌卻下定決心考牌，全因拍戲經常需要駕駛戲份，她直言：「唔想一生人靠綠幕生存。」</p>\n<h2>林愷鈴力撐《金童》拍檔張繼聰進步神速</h2>\n<p>談及過往合作經歷與背景，林愷鈴曾於電影《金童》中首度擔正女主角，她對昔日拍檔張繼聰角逐金馬獎感觸良多，大讚對方非常努力且進步神速，看到拍檔在電影大舞台上發光感到由衷感動。至於考車牌背後另一動機，林愷鈴透露若成功考牌並買入寵物友善座駕，最希望載母親龔慈恩愛犬出遊，以分擔母親近期忙於準備人生首個舞台劇演出壓力。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議呂爵安《悠長假期》預告片造型</h2>\n<p>隨著港版《悠長假期》預告片曝光，網上隨即掀起熱烈討論，不少網民對這個新鮮組合表示期待。針對呂爵安擔心自己在預告片中造型狼狽會顯得太過殘樣，網民紛紛留言表示：「預告入面其實好靚仔！」李佳芯與林愷鈴亦一致力撐拍檔造型具備吸引力。同時有網民對林愷鈴拒絕依賴綠幕大表讚賞，留言稱：「為咗拍戲去考車牌真係好敬業！」認為其專業態度值得肯定。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568560695776023_10283107336b07fce8115f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262364.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568560695776023_10283107336b07fce8115f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561044631751_16131361536b07fceadb98c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262371.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561044631751_16131361536b07fceadb98c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561273951180_12766628136b07fced3ee30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262363.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561273951180_12766628136b07fced3ee30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561490646661_1966547226b07fcef7a4cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568561490646661_1966547226b07fcef7a4cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956856172834650_10890837986b07fcf1e2505.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262368.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956856172834650_10890837986b07fcf1e2505.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562083426198_564435716b07fcf5bbd73.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262367.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562083426198_564435716b07fcf5bbd73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562400290516_19116388326b07fcf85c756.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6070999014238262361.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568562400290516_19116388326b07fcf85c756.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:04:07.391270+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1138,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:33:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:27.864906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:57:25.494028+00:00","content_hash":"f542fff2a602670c11c7809a7ed98a4d6d4f3c1cdb8fc7df6321a528b9edf770","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}